  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$f^{\\prime}(x)=3\\left(\\frac{a^{2}-1}{a^{2}+1}\\right) x^{2}-3$\r\n$\\mathrm{f}^{\\prime}(\\mathrm{x})<0$ for all $\\mathrm{x}$ if $\\mathrm{a}^{2}-1 \\leq 0 \\Rightarrow-1 \\leq \\mathrm{a} \\leq 1$",
